1
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,800
입구
THE OPENING

2
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:01,800
발견한 인부가 아버님이라던데요.
I heard the worker who found it
is your father.

3
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:10,800
…모르는 분입니다.
...I don't know him.

4
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:22,800
「발견 경위: 공사 인부, 성명 미상」
"Found by: a construction worker,
name unknown"

5
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,500
김동수
Kim Dong-su

6
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:56,500
3년 만이구나.
Three years.

7
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,200
같이 가요.
Come with me.

8
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:43,400
만지면 안 돼요.
Don't touch it.

9
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:11,000
눈이… 없는 건가?
It has... no eyes?

10
00:03:12,500 --> 00:03:16,300
여기선 다른 걸로 길을 찾겠죠.
Down here, it must find its way
by something else.

11
00:03:42,200 --> 00:03:46,800
이거 맞죠? 이거면 이름 넣을 수 있어요.
This is yours, isn't it?
With this, I can put your name in.

12
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:49,300
넣지 마라.
Don't.

13
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:03,700
덮었다. 잘릴까 봐.
I covered it up.
I was afraid they'd fire me.

14
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:08,700
내가 찾았다고… 끝내 말 못 했다.
I never could say...
that I was the one who found it.

15
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:39,600
그날, 뒷문에 계신 거 봤어요.
That day, I saw you at the back door.

16
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:46,300
보고도… 모른다고 했어요.
I saw you...
and I said I didn't know you.

17
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:50,200
내가 안 갔어야 했다.
I shouldn't have gone.

18
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:52,600
아니요.
No.

19
00:05:09,500 --> 00:05:11,500
비워 두세요.
Leave it blank.

20
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,800
그럼 이분은…
Then this gentleman is...

21
00:05:16,500 --> 00:05:18,700
제 아버지예요.
He's my father.

22
00:05:26,300 --> 00:05:28,800
아빠. 밥 먹고 가요.
Dad. Stay for dinner.

